PLACEHOLDER — Replace this file with an actual Wireshark export (.pcap or .pcapng) from your local lab capture.

Recommended export steps in Wireshark:
1. Stop the live capture after ≥ 2 minutes.
2. File → Export Specified Packets (or Save As).
3. Choose a descriptive name: wireshark_capture.pcap
4. Commit only captures that contain no real personal or production data.
